/* CNet-private namespace for the unmodified upstream Monocypher C source.
 *
 * CNet and downstream DataBind compile independent private copies of the
 * Monocypher implementation. Never export/interpose its generic crypto_*
 * symbols across native DSOs. Keep the data as well as function names unique,
 * including the global crypto_argon2_no_extras descriptor.
 *
 * Include before monocypher.h in all CNet private callers; the same definitions
 * are used for the single private vendor translation unit. Do not install.
 */
